{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53841","headline":"过盱江麻姑山题绝句 · 缪岛云","name":"过盱江麻姑山题绝句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"万叠峰峦入太清，麻姑从此会方平。\n一从燕罢归何处，宝殿瑶台空月明。\n（见宋赵与虤《娱书堂诗话》卷下）（〖1〗《娱书堂诗话》：「先作『自从』，後於同辈举似，同辈云：『诗固清矣，自字未稳，当作一字。\n』云服其言。\n暨再入山，已爲人改作『一从』矣。\n亦可谓一字师。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"缪岛云","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53841.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53841","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}